{
  "$schema": "./schema/ping.schema.json",
  "design_notes": [
    "Design section 3.4. Quick pings and emoji reactions are shown on the host screen next to the avatar of the sender; ping.send (17.4) carries the ID.",
    "The screen-reader labels of the emoji are added by the data author for section 16 (screen-reader labels on phone UI); the design lists only the emoji.",
    "Role tags: \"a role-holder can put a Recommended or Concern badge on any option in their area. The badge is visible to all.\" The design has no table mapping roles to part categories (data/roles.json).",
    "Voice is not data: players in the same room talk, remote groups use their own voice chat."
  ],
  "free_text_chat": false,
  "quick_pings": [
    {
      "id": "too_expensive",
      "text_key": "ping.too_expensive.text"
    },
